From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:44:46 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] llama: keep a prompt cache entry a longer one cannot resume

A longer prompt used to drop every shorter prefix. A state that cannot rewind stays when the longer prompt has no mark at that length.
---
